    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 156,
        "text": "I am trying a different morning routine for the next two weeks. I used to miss breakfast when I had an early shift, and then I felt sleepy at the desk.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "4265558e9d12826b0a05eb9936f4740388eb823f87a21edd576732ef98f5b5c9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 163,
        "sourceEnd": 185,
        "text": "What have you changed?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "587c222f8060b561cdb5c2ab0655cb6f771796c3b9244eb7b3a15fdecfb71c9a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 191,
        "sourceEnd": 346,
        "text": "I prepare a snack and a bottle of water the night before. If I am hungry or thirsty later, I can decide what I need. My appetite is different on busy days.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f8f3b1a9c057a0746c73cac15b6e88dfa39c1322447144ddb0b135f0f442d651",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 353,
        "sourceEnd": 492,
        "text": "That sounds practical. I used to take a nap every afternoon, but now I usually walk for a few minutes instead. I still rest when I need to.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "5afa3a7f2498f29802357f95accd6e0302bff62ba1efbd7b05afe2283c8581b7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 498,
        "sourceEnd": 629,
        "text": "I have also written my bedtime in a journal. I do not think the notes are a medical test. They only help me remember what happened.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "8667aaff9198f4e9f0184b1ddab7039a9cd15d048b3fbd9abb88b8f285a9b64d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 636,
        "sourceEnd": 844,
        "text": "Our cooking group read a nutrition leaflet yesterday. It listed protein and fiber as examples of nutrients. It also mentioned a vitamin and a mineral, but it did not say that one food is perfect for everyone.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "6a5e8d6a184673c365e092d03747c48a842dc3294818d594bbc8c26271d4e5b8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 850,
        "sourceEnd": 981,
        "text": "I brought bread made with wheat. It is one kind of grain. For supper, I will choose something simple after I see what is available.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b3409ff767296e21ca51caca38b845365eda0859963ea992436a49f928704ebc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 988,
        "sourceEnd": 1027,
        "text": "Do you have time to be active at lunch?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1ac633c40cd0630f07ab2418ec629e8d8ce7a8efbb8cd3df5dcf6da0d8c99376",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 1033,
        "sourceEnd": 1195,
        "text": "Sometimes. I stretch near my desk and take a slow breath before the next meeting. It helps me relax, although I cannot say that it removes every source of stress.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "33ca536a88fa187d2e764a911ee9a49516f7790a98e7203d92a98108e52c978c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 1202,
        "sourceEnd": 1333,
        "text": "My mood changes for many reasons too. I used to expect a fast change, but now I prefer a gradual adjustment that fits my lifestyle.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "2cf0f21c119c2e8f782c06dee0ed163f8058dd2901aae161c6dec41bc66fe04c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 1339,
        "sourceEnd": 1480,
        "text": "The instructor said to stop and ask for suitable advice if a muscle hurts. We can check our own needs instead of copying someone else's plan.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9d4ca2570fba347548adec0e54bbc5e8fa78db3bc39650e924737c3a945a522f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 1487,
        "sourceEnd": 1576,
        "text": "Yes. We can choose a regular habit that fits our needs. We can compare notes next Friday.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "7ff11dc9b7fc4957f332931698965926a2069403d677b9ecda20a53d6ecc281b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 1582,
        "sourceEnd": 1625,
        "text": "I will write down what I notice until then.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "52c9d5b42e796962e98018eb67d8bd267642db1a26c660d33e53dc5b2b65c582",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
